1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,555
Quick, what's older:

2
00:00:01,555 --> 00:00:02,468
the Sun...

3
00:00:02,468 --> 00:00:04,221
or the water you drink?

4
00:00:04,221 --> 00:00:05,521
The WATER.

5
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:07,140
You've been sipping...

6
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,333
leftovers.

7
00:00:08,390 --> 00:00:10,067
Before the Sun was born,

8
00:00:10,113 --> 00:00:10,955
up to half of it

9
00:00:10,955 --> 00:00:11,855
was ice...

10
00:00:11,855 --> 00:00:14,433
in a freezing, dark cloud.

11
00:00:14,489 --> 00:00:15,480
How do we know?

12
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:16,837
It's a teeny bit too

13
00:00:16,837 --> 00:00:17,680
HEAVY...

14
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,800
for the baby Sun to make.

15
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:22,040
And you're mostly water.

16
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,040
So...

17
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,300
bits of YOU

18
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,510
are older than the Sun.

